</td>
                <td style="width: 430px; height: 13px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>A = Major</bold>
</td>
                <td style="width: 384.802px; height: 13px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>B = Minor</bold>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 26px;">
                <td style="width: 186px; height: 26px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Facial&#x000a0;</td>
                <td style="width: 430px; height: 26px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Typical facial dysmorphology (facial features vary with age)</td>
                <td style="width: 384.802px; height: 26px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Suggestive facial dysmorphology</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 40px;">
                <td style="width: 186px; height: 40px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Cardiac</td>
                <td style="width: 430px; height: 40px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Pulmonary valve stenosis, hypertrophic cardiomyopathy, and electrocardiographic results typical of Noonan syndrome</td>
