<p>Any one of the following:</p>
<list list-type="bullet"><list-item><p>Intellectual disability</p></list-item><list-item><p>Cryptorchidism</p></list-item><list-item><p>Lymphatic vessel dysplasia</p></list-item></list>
</td>
